Katran: A High Performance Layer 4 Load Balancer (Das et al., 2018)
Method: Uses eBPF and XDP to build a Layer-4 load balancer for web traffic.
Dataset: Meta production data center traffic.
Advantages: Drastically reduces CPU overhead for network load balancing.
Limitations: Optimized only for stateless web traffic, not game streams.
Research Gap: Kernel-bypass routing tailored for stateful UDP game streams.
Possible Improvements: Customizes eBPF routing to handle continuous, stateful game synchronization streams.
